  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Country Programme for Inclusive and Sustainable Industrial Development in Benin Republic</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In a letter of request to the Resident Coordinator of the United Nations system in Benin, the Minister of Industry and Commerce requested for UNIDO&apos;s technical support in four areas: 1. Institutional and legislative framework for conformity assessment; 2. Trade infrastructure management tools; 3. International market study of petroleum products and updates of price structure; and 4. Consumers&apos; code.  Further to the above, the Minister of Planning and Development wrote to UNIDO DG to request for the technical assistance of the organization to promote ISID in Benin.</narrative>
  </description>
